WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.830
<i>Since there's a mountain, it's a mountain.</i>

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.320
<i>Don't have to worry if there's a river.</i>

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:01.070
Hey, don't sing such a weird song from the top of your lungs.  It's embarrassing.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.970
What are you saying, Aisha?

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.420
When you walk in the mountains, you're supposed to sing, to avoid the bears.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.220
Grandpa told me that.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:16.630
That's right.  If a bear suddenly faces Aisha deep in a mountain like this...  It'd be the one surprised.

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:22.920
Yes, yes, if it faces me suddenly in a place like this...  It'll be pitiful for the bear.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.180
And why would that be?

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.940
Uh, what? Is something wrong with my face?

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:34.700
No, I was right.  You're more entertaining than Kousonsan.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:43.370
<b>Kan'u Exterminates a Monster</b>

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:45.780
How cruel.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.910
You tricked me.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.010
No, we didn't trick you.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:54.860
You told me, you'll show me a shortcut to the village.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.380
But, you led me to the middle of nowhere.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.250
We will show you a shortcut...

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.770
Not to the village, but to heaven.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:10.900
Heaven?!  So you're planning on killing me.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:18.570
No, you got it all wrong!  We'll make you feel so good; you'll think you've gone to heaven!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:23.580
Your heaven sounds like a pretty good place.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:26.380
Of course it is the best...

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.710
Who are you guys?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.180
Listen and be afraid!

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:36.610
This person, might not be the most beautiful or striking...

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.220
Hey!

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.710
It's the black hair bandit hunter!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.610
I won't let bullies escape!

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:48.220
And I don't like foul mouth criminals.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.600
Unfortunately, we are not guides to heaven but...

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.820
I can send you to hell with my Green Dragon Crest Blade!

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:58.110
Let's see you do it!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:03:59.210
To hell!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:00.360
We are!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.820
Going!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.210
That's what they deserve!

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:07.200
Thank you for saving me.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.720
To get rid of scary bandits like that.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:14.830
All of you must be very strong.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.880
Oh no, it's nothing like that.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:23.010
It's a little bit late but, my name is...

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:26.550
To-to... Tonton.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:29.360
That's a cool name, just like mine.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.310
Oh, is that so?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:33.870
I am Kan'u.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.180
I'm Chōhi.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.730
And you are?

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.450
I am Chōun.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:48.130
So, Tonton if you are heading to the village, why not come with us?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.860
Is that okay?

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:55.580
There is no need to worry.  When traveling what is needed is a companion, in life…

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.560
“What are you going to do after making me drunk?” it is.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.810
Yeah, that’s it.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.100
Dummy!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.580
That doesn’t make any sense!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.370
Yue, Yue?  Where are you?

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:21.140
That girl, running off to god knows where, again!

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:25.380
Geez, we are swamped.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.660
Oh, General Kayuu.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.880
Hi, Ka Ku.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.100
Why do you look so worried?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:36.760
Yue… uh, I mean, Toutaku has disappeared again.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.910
Up to her usual antics, I see.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.220
Observing the lives of her subjects in disguise.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:44.740
Yes.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:51.060
Geez, how irresponsible of her to neglect her work.

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:56.200
There are no rules against fraternizing with the commoners.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.020
Then what’s wrong?

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:03.780
But it shouldn’t be like this!  These days, our manpower is invested in punishing villagers.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:07.350
Peace and order around here has been deteriorating.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:12.220
In addition, prices are inflating and people are becoming weary.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.870
On top of everything, a man-eating bear or monster has appeared in the mountain!

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:19.700
Ka Ku, relax! You’re gonna give yourself a heart attack.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.390
General Kayuu.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:25.230
Then I’ll guess you live to be 100.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.810
Well, I do try to maintain a nice and strong body!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.030
Eh, did you say a monster?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:40.720
Yes, one night, an arrow decorated with white feathers pierced the chief’s gate.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.300
There was a letter attached to it.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.980
"Tonight, offer food to the temple in the outskirts of the village…"

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:52.830
"Otherwise, disaster will fall upon the village."  That’s what I heard was written in the letter.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:58.960
At first, everyone thought it was just some kind of a prank.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:03.850
When morning came, as if it was carried from the mountain.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.480
A huge boulder was placed in front of the village gate.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:08.960
I see.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:13.460
It wasn’t something humanly possibly.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.410
It had to be an act by a monster.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:24.120
So the villagers made the food offering to the temple, that night.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:31.370
Ever since, every seven days, the same way, they get a letter demanding more offerings.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.590
How strange.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:40.840
But these are only rumors I heard in the city.   I wanted to see the truth for myself.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:45.640
Tonton, why would you want to do that?

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.210
That’s not something a girl will do out of curiosity.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.810
Eh,… well…

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.400
What’s that?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.850
This must be the boulder left by the monster.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:15.030
So, chief, is it true that there’s been monster sightings?

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:20.600
Yes… We were so troubled that we asked for the assistance of our lord but…

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:29.790
We were reprimanded and were told not to bother the lord with our “monster” problem.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.510
How cruel!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:46.930
So we asked the village's strong men, and traveling swordmen for help in slaying the monster.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.360
Unfortunately, they all ran with their tails between their legs.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:53.870
Was the monster that scary?

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:58.930
Nobody has actually seen it.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:04.330
One person described him as being over 20 feet tall, with glowing red eyes.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:09.290
Another person said he had sharp horns and fangs.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:15.480
A different person mentioned he was covered in fur with a fierce growl.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:22.770
What will become of us now?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.470
This is where we come in, right?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.590
What?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.330
I thought you’d be the one bringing it up.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.450
Can I ask you?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.660
But you don’t know what you’ll be up against.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:44.080
These travelers are very strong, they defeated a fierce group of bandits in a heartbeat.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:49.120
They are confident enough to face the monster.

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:51.530
Oh, then please…

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.980
This is not a decision to be made lightly.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:59.050
That’s right.  I have my reasons too.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.760
You mean you won’t help?

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.240
It’s not that we won’t…

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:10.240
Please, I beg of you.  The villagers are in desperate need of help.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.710
Pleaaassse!

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.020
Now, that you put it like that…

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:21.790
That’s great. You are going to accept!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.780
Umm…well…

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:26.030
Thank you very much!

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:43.800
You two seem to be trembling a bit?  Could it be that you are scared?

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.350
I’m not scared!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:51.550
Of course, I am not!  I am trembling…out of anticipation!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.870
Oh, really?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.250
What? Do you doubt me?

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:59.690
No.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.960
What?  Did you see something?

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:05.980
No.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:11.550
It is disappointing that clouds are covering the beautiful moon.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.760
That's it?

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.600
What is it this time?

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:29.090
Yesterday, at the tea shop, didn’t you eat one dango stick more than me?

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:32.770
I think you are right.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.790
You don’t need to have so many random thoughts.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:40.430
You’re doing this on purpose, aren’t you?

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.430
That is all.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:57.160
Well then we entrust the rest to you.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.050
Y-yes…

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.590
Good luck slaying the monster.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.340
Leave it to us!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:13.220
How should I put this? Something’s very likely to come out.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:22.420
We’ll wait until the monster shows itself.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.440
Y-yes…

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:30.930
Just to think of it, it was a moonless night like this…

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:37.120
I was trying to cross the mountain before the sunset.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:41.850
I walked for miles, before realizing I took the wrong road.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:46.190
I thought, I had no other choice but to camp out.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:52.480
An unseasonably warm spring breeze blew out of nowhere.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:06.960
I don’t how long I was asleep before I heard a scratching noise.

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:13.970
At first, I thought, it was a mouse in the attic.

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:18.340
Trying to find the source of the noise, I noticed a new coffin…

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:26.250
I felt a bad omen, but I was lured to lay my hand on it.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:31.350
I fearfully opened it…

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:40.910
I might’ve overdone it a bit.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.520
Hey, Aisha.  Rin Rin.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:54.220
Wake up…

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.710
It’s the monster!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.300
It is!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.230
You finally showed up.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.390
You’re revealing your identity.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:33.280
I don’t easily scare, like those two fainted at your feet.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.740
That is a strong strike!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.980
This guy is really powerful!  But...

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.670
What?  It’s not a monster!

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:17.080
No, it’s definitely human.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:20.320
Damn it, how dare it deceive us?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.670
Now that we know it’s human, we won’t be scared.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:27.010
So you were scared before.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.000
Umm, that’s…

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:34.990
Anyway, next time, I will take care of it.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.440
I’ll beat the crap out of it too!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.450
True, that it wasn’t a monster.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:44.320
But it was strong as a monster.

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.770
Strong as a monster...

00:15:53.830 --> 00:16:00.080
You didn’t have to come with us.  You could have waited in the village.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:06.930
If we’re not dealing with a monster, there must be a reason for doing this.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.810
If so, maybe we can listen to what it…

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:10.610
I found something.

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:17.030
These must be its tracks.

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.940
It’s going that way.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.100
We should follow it.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.640
Hey, that…

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.150
Yes, it’s most likely its hide out.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.160
Stand back!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.050
Yes.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:45.960
Watch out, it’s her!

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:48.880
Look it’s the fainters.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:53.020
We were caught off guard last night.  It’s not going to happen this time!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.600
I’ll give you a taste of my strength.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:58.880
You must have a name, if you’re not a monster.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.510
Ryofu Housen.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.620
I’ve never met anyone like her.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.740
What is she?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.550
I told you…  Her strength is inhuman.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.460
Oh no!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.800
Stop it, stop it.  It tickles.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:52.830
You guys are good guys.  I can’t fight against the good guys.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:04.950
So the reason you asked for the offering was to feed your dog.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:09.920
I tried to make money but…

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.190
Umm…

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:20.770
Welcome… back… my master…

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:24.090
Let's see, fried rice and dumplings for me.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.790
Same for me, but I want a large order of fried rice.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:30.770
Dan Dan noodles for me.  With a spring roll.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:34.380
Double cooked pork with white rice and egg soup for me.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.700
Four Ramens.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.140
That’s absolutely not good.

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.530
Look who’s talking.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:46.600
You don’t need that much food for one puppy.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.350
There isn’t just one.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.350
Huh!  These are…

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:04.940
Friends.  Many.  These dogs were all abandoned or injured.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:08.410
They were too cute, I couldn’t leave them.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.360
Oh, Yue!

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.200
Ei!

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:22.610
Don’t Ei me!  Do you know how worried I was, until now?

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.040
I am sorry.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:29.000
It is commendable to sympathize with your subjects.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.620
What would have happened if you were in a dangerous situation?

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.500
No need to worry.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:39.460
I had people to save me.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.400
So you did get into a dangerous situation?!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.510
Well, just a bit.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:52.870
Umm, sorry to interrupt but…  You are?

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.580
My name is Ka Ku Bunwa.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.450
I work for lord Toutaku here.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:01.900
What?!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.030
What about the monster?

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.740
It’s already been resolved.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:08.690
Oh, I see.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.350
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:27.890
I see. That’s how it was.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:32.400
Surely, what Ryofu did was wrong.

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:38.980
But, it was to save the injured and abandoned dogs.

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:43.120
She didn’t have any evil intentions.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:49.250
She will immediately get rid of the boulder in front of the gate.  She promised to make it up as much as possible.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.460
Right, Ryofu?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.120
Okay, then.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:05.470
Since she personally apologized to me, I will talk to the villagers myself.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.610
It would be a great help.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.060
By the way, Ei.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:16.890
I hear no one in the public office bothered with the monster sighting complaint.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.210
Umm, well…

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:23.480
Lord Toutaku, that’s a thing of the past.

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.620
No, it’s not right.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:35.000
Listening to the needs of the people is the basis of politics.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:42.350
I understand.  I will personally instruct the officers, so nothing like this ever happens again.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:45.920
That’s good.  Also...

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:51.320
Can’t we keep them?

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.460
You mean all these dogs?

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:59.840
Ei, you said before, one reason why peace and order is deteriorating is because...

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:03.090
We have insufficient soldiers and guards.

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:09.230
We will have the dogs properly trained to help protect the city.

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.250
That’s a good plan isn’t it?

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:17.440
If they are properly trained they might prevent burglaries but…

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:21.210
There is no need to worry about that.

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:24.880
Ryofu, can I ask you to train the dogs?

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:30.510
Wait Yue, I never said you can keep them.

00:22:31.540 --> 00:22:34.020
We can’t?

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:37.430
I beg of you.

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:41.070
Umm, that’s…

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:50.140
I got it … we will.

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:54.310
Thank you Ei!  I love you very much.

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:56.930
Hey, Yue, “love me very much?”

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:02.560
Just to let you know, this is the last time I will let you manipulate me.

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:05.140
I mean it!

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:07.620
Hey, what?

00:23:07.890 --> 00:23:10.340
This must be how she shows her gratitude.

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:14.940
Then just say it!  Instead of hanging on me!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:34.970
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:40.030
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:41.450 --> 00:23:45.790
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:50.500
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:55.660
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:55.720 --> 00:24:00.660
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:05.920
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:13.320
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:18.500
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:23.790
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:23.890 --> 00:24:28.800
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:29.010 --> 00:24:33.990
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:44.070 --> 00:24:51.160
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
